// Windows application icon embedded in the executable. Resource id 1 (the lowest)
// is the icon the shell shows for the .exe itself: in File Explorer, on the
// desktop and on the taskbar. CMake (configure_file) injects an absolute path so
// the resource compiler resolves it regardless of its working directory.
1 ICON "@LATRUNCULI_ICON_PATH@"
